    {
      "audio_path": null,
      "back": {
        "confusion": {
          "vi": "Kind of / sort of trong văn viết thay bằng somewhat, rather; stuff, things thay bằng danh từ cụ thể; and so on, and things like that thay bằng such as + ví dụ."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "target": "Spoken: There's loads of stuff we can do to cut costs. → Written: Several measures could be taken to reduce costs.",
