          "question_type": "cefr_listen_detail",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Woman: Good morning, Park Road Dental Surgery.\nMan: Hello, I've got an appointment on Thursday at ten, but I'm afraid I can't make Thursday morning any more. Have you got anything on Friday?\nWoman: Let me see... Friday's fully booked, I'm afraid. I could offer you Thursday afternoon at four, or next Monday at nine.\nMan: I'd rather not leave work early, so Monday would be better.\nWoman: Fine, Monday at nine it is.",
          "section": "listening",
          "seq": 1
