          "question_type": "cefr_listen_detail",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Man: You're late. Did the train break down again?\nWoman: No, the trains were fine for once. My car wouldn't start, so I was going to cycle in, but it was pouring with rain.\nMan: Oh no. So what did you do?\nWoman: Luckily my neighbour was driving into town anyway, so she gave me a lift.",
