          "question_type": "cefr_listen_detail",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Woman: Have you decided what to get your sister for her birthday?\nMan: I was thinking of a book, like last year, but she hardly reads these days. She's really into running now.\nWoman: What about some new running shoes, then?\nMan: She's very fussy about shoes. She'd want to try them on first. I think I'll get her some wireless headphones, so she can listen to music while she runs.",
