          "question_type": "cefr_listen_opinion",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Man: So how's the new job going?\nWoman: Well, the people are lovely, and the office is right next to the station, which is great. But to be honest, the work itself isn't what I expected. I spend most of the day answering emails, and I hardly use my design skills at all. I'll give it a few more months, but I've already started looking at other jobs.",
