          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Man: What did you think of the film?\nWoman: The acting was brilliant, especially the main actor. But it was far too long. I nearly fell asleep in the middle.\nMan: I know what you mean. Two and a half hours is a lot. I quite liked the story, though.\nWoman: Really? I thought the ending was a bit silly.",
