          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Man: Hello, this is Daniel from Brightway Furniture. I'm calling about the sofa you ordered last month. Unfortunately, the delivery company has had a problem with one of its lorries, so we won't be able to deliver it on Wednesday as planned. We can bring it on Friday morning instead, or if that isn't convenient, you can choose another day on our website. I'm very sorry for the inconvenience.",
