          "script": "This is an announcement for passengers on flight BA 274 to Rome. We regret to announce that this flight is delayed by approximately forty minutes because of bad weather at Rome airport. Boarding will now begin at a quarter past two from gate twelve, not gate eight as shown on your boarding card. Passengers are reminded that only one piece of hand luggage is allowed on board. Thank you.",
