          "question_type": "cefr_listen_detail",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Woman: Hi, I'd like to renew my gym membership, please.\nMan: Sure. It's thirty-five pounds a month, or you can pay for the whole year upfront for three hundred and sixty.\nWoman: Three sixty… that works out cheaper, doesn't it?\nMan: It does, but bear in mind that the annual plan can't be frozen if you get injured or go away.\nWoman: Hmm. I'm travelling for most of the summer, so I'd be paying for months I don't use. I'll stick with monthly.",
