          "question_type": "cefr_listen_gist",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Woman: Have you seen the email about the new open-plan office?\nMan: Yes. Apparently they're knocking down the walls on the third floor in June.\nWoman: I'm not sure how I'll concentrate. I'm on the phone to clients half the day.\nMan: They said there'll be some quiet rooms you can book. Still, I imagine they'll be fully booked most of the time.\nWoman: Exactly. I think I'll ask whether I can work from home on the days I've got a lot of calls.",
