          "question_type": "cefr_listen_announcement",
          "rubric": null,
          "sample_answer": null,
          "script": "Good morning, delegates. A couple of changes to today's programme. Professor Lindqvist's keynote, originally scheduled for nine thirty in the main hall, has been pushed back to eleven, as her flight was diverted overnight. In its place, the panel discussion on research funding will go ahead at nine thirty, but in Room B rather than the main hall, which is being set up for this afternoon's session. Anyone who had registered for the eleven o'clock workshops should check the noticeboard, as two of them will now run at the same time as the keynote rather than being cancelled.",
